# Ignore build output
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Ignore Visual Studio temporary files
.vs/
*.user
*.suo

# Ignore build artifacts
*.dll
*.pdb
*.exe
*.cache
*.log

# Ignore publish folders
**/wwwroot/dist/
**/wwwroot/build/

